CLASS:: MPEGDecodeOutput
SUMMARY:: PCM and decoder status signals
CATEGORIES:: UGens>MPEG Audio
RELATED:: Guides/MPEGAudio, Classes/MP3Decode, Classes/MPEGFrame

DESCRIPTION::
Returned by any decoder’s arInfo or bytesInfo method.

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: audio
One audio signal or a stereo array.

METHOD:: state, frames, drops
Audio-rate state, processed frame count and transport drops. State is 0 during startup, 1 when decoding or −1 after an error.
